      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Surveyed in 1876, Archer City was planned to sit on three future railroad routes: Fort Worth‑Denver, Houston‑Central, and Red River‑Rio Grande.",
